.TH tapectl-collection-plan 1  "tapectl-collection-plan " 
.SH NAME
tapectl\-collection\-plan \- Show the batch plan (alphabetical first\-fit, §7) for every configured collection\*(Aqs pending units
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtapectl collection plan\fR [\fB\-\-copies\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-y\fR|\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the batch plan (alphabetical first\-fit, §7) for every configured collection\*(Aqs pending units
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-copies\fR \fI<COPIES>\fR [default: 2]
Copies to plan for — informational only (batches don\*(Aqt change; this scales the printed cartridge\-count estimate)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Output in JSON format
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show what would be done without making changes
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose output
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip confirmation prompts
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
